    heading: "description-40",
    content: "When the lock is occupied, to ensure that your business is not affected, you may need to revoke the lock and give other users a chance to obtain it. Revoke the occupied lock by calling `revokeLock`. When the lock is revoked, all users in the channel receive the `lockReleased` type of the `lock` event. See Event Listeners."
